"""NAPI op-code and status constants — shared by all NAPI sub-dispatchers.

This module is the single source of truth for op IDs and status codes.
It has NO imports from other Jac modules so any dispatcher can import from
here without creating circular dependencies.

Op IDs must stay in sync with the NapiOp enum in napi/shim/napi_shim.c.
Status codes must stay in sync with napi_status in <node_api_types.h>.
"""

